Package: BisonExplorR
Title: Interactive R Tutorials for Introductory Biology at Bucknell University
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
        "Alexandra",
        "Orr",
        email = "aso003@bucknell.edu",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: A collection of interactive learnr tutorials supporting the
    BIOL 203/204 Integrated Concepts in Biology laboratory curriculum at
    Bucknell University. Provides guided practice in data organization,
    visualization, statistical analysis, and biological interpretation using
    interactive exercises and biological datasets.
